# Vercel scope (mandatory)

When using Vercel CLI, dashboard changes, env vars, deploys, or domain settings:

- **Only** the Vercel project named **`voltgear`**.
- **Only** the production shop domain **`buyntryy.com`** (and its Vercel aliases for that project).
- App path in repo: **`apps/storefront`** (shop).

**Never** without explicit user request:

- Deploy, link, update, or delete **any other** Vercel project (including admin, previews on other teams, or unrelated Hassaan/ecommerce projects).
- Run bulk commands that affect all projects (`vercel deploy` without confirming project, mass env push to wrong project).

Before any `vercel` command: confirm target is **`voltgear`** (e.g. `vercel link --project voltgear`, root `apps/storefront` per monorepo setup).
